            "review_title": "Review at Quán Ốc Vân",
            "review_text": "Bandit-One\nLucerne, Switzerland12053 contributions\n0\nA real hidden gem\nOct 2025 • Couples\nWalked by the little restaurant the day before. Was really busy, mostly all locals. A good sign. And the food on the tables looked delicous. So we tried our luck the next night. The rain just stopped, so we were lucky and got a table right away. A bit later the place was packed with people even lining up for a table.\n\nIt's a really fun atmosphere here. Tables right at the street (not a too busy one), low seats and everybody seems to have a good time. And so did we.\n\nOrdered several fish and seafood dishes. Which it is all about here. Grilled shrimp and crab claws, stuffed mussels, sea snails and scallops. Food did arrive very quickly. The seafood was really fresh and nicely prepared. All of the items delicous. Went well with the cold beers that we ordered.\n\nA real gem, this one. A great find. And at a great value. Be prepared to wait for a table or show up early. But either way: It's definitely worth it.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2025",
